#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/pipelineLog.py:78
msgid ""
"Enabling logging of WorldVoice’s speech pipeline will reduce speech response "
"speed. If you are not debugging, we recommend keeping it disabled. Would you "
"like to enable it anyway?"
msgstr ""
"启用 WorldVoice 的语音流程日志记录功能会降低语音响应速度。如果你不进行调试，"
"我们建议你将其禁用。你仍然要启用它吗？"

#. Translators: The title of the dialog
#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/pipelineLog.py:81
#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/pipelineLog.py:95
#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/pipelineLog.py:111
msgid "Speech Pipeline Logging"
msgstr "语音流程日志"

#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/pipelineLog.py:92
msgid ""
"Logging of WorldVoice’s speech pipeline has been disabled. Would you like to "
"export the pipeline log now?"
msgstr "WorldVoice的语音流程日志已被禁用。你想现在导出语音流程日志吗？"

#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/pipelineLog.py:108
msgid ""
"Logging of WorldVoice’s speech pipeline is enabled. This may reduce speech "
"response speed. If you are not debugging, we recommend disabling it. Would "
"you like to disable it now?"
msgstr ""
"WorldVoice 的语音流程日志记录已启用。这可能会降低语音响应速度。如果你不进行调"
"试，我们建议你禁用此功能。你是否要立即禁用？"

#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/utils.py:16
#, python-brace-format
